<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Starways, Season 2: Keep Your Enemies Closer</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"My name is Adora. I was a Horde pilot, once - but not any more. Now, I fight for the Rebellion - and for my friends, Glimmer and Bow. We've won some small victories, and a couple of larger ones, but Horde space is vast, and our ship, the &lt;em&gt;Protector&lt;/em&gt;, is small and defenceless. Guile and deception are as much our allies as strength and speed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not long ago, I found a sword - a First One artefact. It's strange, and powerful...and it's a part of me, somehow. With it, I can draw upon the power of a myth - the legendary She-Ra. I don't know what's happening, or how I fit into this mystery...but I know there's only one way I can find out."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or: The &lt;em&gt;Protector&lt;/em&gt; continues its journey toward Brightmoon and the Free Territories, while Adora tries to navigate the status her new powers give her - and Catra and Scorpia try to navigate the new world they find themselves in after fleeing the Horde...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>CountDorku</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
